  "historyNote": "#4924, eff 8-24-90, EXPIRED 8-24-96 New. #6981, eff 4-22-99; ss by #8847, INTERIM, eff 4-16-07, EXPIRED: 10-13-07 New. #9058, eff 1-3-08, EXPIRED: 1-3-16",
